{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40844","headline":"复覩三乡题处留赠 · 贾驰","name":"复覩三乡题处留赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壁古字未灭，声长响不绝。\n蕙质本如云，松心应耐雪。\n耿耿离幽谷，悠悠望瓯越。\n杞妇哭夫时，城崩无此说。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾驰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}